    "description": "Objective\n\nExtend POC-07's Deal-Rep Assignment object with a usable interface for the real-world pattern of multiple reps per Deal and frequent on/off toggling of assignments.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\nButton on the Deal record page (e.g. \"Manage Rep Assignments\") opening a custom interface\n\nInterface supports assigning/unassigning multiple reps in a single action\n\nEach change creates a new Deal-Rep Assignment history record per POC-07's non-overwrite model; toggling off sets Assignment Status to Ended/Paused rather than deleting\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\nA user can add or remove multiple reps from a Deal in a single interaction\n\nFull assignment history remains queryable/reportable\n\nTesting Notes\n\nTest overlapping and sequential assignment scenarios for the same Deal\n\nOut of Scope\n\nAutomated conflict/overlap validation (per POC-07), rep quota enforcement\n\nOpen Questions\n\nResolve POC-07's open questions first (Date/Time vs. Date precision on Effective From/To, whether overlapping assignments are blocked) — needed to finalize this UI's validation rules\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nFinal scope/estimate to be confirmed after the 7/8 in-person working session.\n\n\\----------------------------------------\n\nEstimate: M · \\~8-10h (pending in-person scoping) · Dependencies: POC-07 · Ticket BUILD-09 (approved 2026-07-07)\n\nSource: Raised during Wagertech <> Jumpr Weekly Sync, 2026-07-07; to be scoped further at the 7/8 in-person session.",
